{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
I've been [A]standing underneath this dark old cloud
[Bm]Waiting for the sun to [E]shine
[Bm7]Waiting for the sun to [E]shine in my heart [A]again[E]
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[A]I've [E]been [A]throwing a lot of good love away
[Bm]Waiting for the sun to [E]shine
[Bm7]Waiting for the sun to [E]shine in my heart [A]again
{end_of_verse}


{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
